Subject: server: mount Baton's services, workers and fabric.* RPC group

server.ts provides BatonServerLayer.services and starts BatonServerLayer.workers beside
upstream's reactors. ws.ts merges BatonRpcGroup onto the socket's group, adds its handlers and
its own scope middleware (upstream's throws for methods its table does not list).

